-- -----------------------------------------------------
-- KIRISHIMA FAMILY
-- =====================================================================
-- Scenarios in this seed
-- =====================================================================
-- 1  Four families: Kirishima (Totoro) > Heartfilia (Fairy Tail) > Uzumaki/Namikaze (Naruto) > Tsukino + others (Sailor Moon, Spirited Away, Howl's Moving Castle)
-- 2  Partial timelines: Some characters have only baptism; others have full sequences (baptism → first communion → confirmation)
-- 3  Same-name awareness: Not applicable in this seed (names are distinct anime titles)
-- 4  Baptized in another parish: Kiki (Kagawa), Howl (Wales), Sophie (Market Chipping) — source='other_parish'; certificates cannot be printed for these
-- 5  Out-of-parish marriage: Application 2 (Boruto 13 + Mamoru 24), requirements partly missing (bride CENOMAR not received)
-- 6  New baptism from an online application: application 1 (Grace Mamoru), no person linked yet
-- 7  Representative pickup: certificate request 2 (matched, paid, ID verified)
-- 8  Correction request: not applicable in this demo
-- 9  Siblings with same parents: Boruto & Himawari Uzumaki, Satsuki & Mei Kirishima, Usagi & Shingo Tsukino
-- 10 Certificate statuses present: new (x2 unpaid), matched (paid, ID-verified), ready (printed, priest signed), released (counter ID verified), rejected (other_parish miss)
-- 11 Payment is recorded BEFORE processing: every matched/printed/released request has paid_at; request 1 (new, unpaid) cannot be matched until payment recorded
-- 12 Funeral records for 4 deceased persons: older generation (Tatsuo, Minato) and middle generation (Layla, Yuko)
-- 13 parents_union_type variety: canonical (most common), civil (not used in demo), common_law (not used but enum available), unmarried (Kiki's application)
-- 14 other_parish baptisms: Kiki, Howl, Sophie — these rows have source='other_parish' and book_verified_at=NULL so certificates will not print
-- =====================================================================